batdoc includes or derives from:

- pdf-extract 0.10 (https://github.com/jrmuizel/pdf-extract), MIT license,
  Jeff Muizelaar and Mozilla contributors — vendored with modifications
  under crates/pdf-extract (panic-free decoding, glyph recovery).
- liteparse (https://github.com/run-llama/liteparse), Apache-2.0 — PDF
  layout algorithms (reading order, columns, headings, tables, OCR merge)
  reimplemented in batdoc-core/src/pdf_layout.rs, pdf_ocr.rs, and
  crates/pdf-extract/src/font_cmap.rs. No liteparse code or data tables
  were copied.
